  "body": "• Generous 3,349sqm (approx.) development site positioned in the heart of Mairangi Bay\r\n• Approved Resource Consent in place for 10 architecturally designed townhouses\r\n• On-site stormwater and wastewater manholes, simplifying future development\r\n• Townhouse floor areas consented between 170sqm and 236sqm (approx.), offering strong market appeal\r\n• Short walk to top local schools including Murrays Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate, and the highly regarded Rangitoto College\r\n• Stroll to Mairangi Bay beach and village amenities - childcare, playground, cafés, restaurants, and supermarket\r\n• Approx. 5-minute drive to Rosedale shops and Apollo Medical Centre\r\n• Easy access to motorway links, Park & Ride, public transport, and just 10 minutes (approx.) to Albany Shopping Centre and Massey University\r\n• 43 Penzance Road: Four-bedroom home with two living areas and two bathrooms on 2,559sqm (approx.)\r\n• 30 Hythe Terrace: Three-bedroom home with two living areas and one bathroom on 790sqm (approx.)\r\n\r\nAn exceptional opportunity for developers, savvy investors, or those seeking a strategic land bank in a strengthening property market",
